# UPSTREAM.revision

This directory is a **pinned snapshot** of the upstream `astrology-skill`
repository, not a git submodule.

The first line of this file is the full 40-character commit SHA of the
upstream tree that was copied here:

    660d992a61139ed0286eaf0a38f4e8e0fd4f7822

Upstream: https://github.com/wvanderen/astrology-skill.git

## Why a snapshot instead of a submodule

Upstream `main` was force-pushed after this pin was chosen; the pinned
commit is no longer reachable from any upstream ref, and GitHub refuses
direct SHA fetches of it (`upload-pack: not our ref`). A submodule
gitlink at this SHA would fail to materialize on every fresh clone and
in CI. The snapshot copy keeps the exact, verified revision available
in this repository's own history instead.

## Invariants

- The tree (everything except this file) is byte-identical to
  `git archive 660d992a61139ed0286eaf0a38f4e8e0fd4f7822` from upstream.
- Do not edit files under this directory. To upgrade the skill, replace
  the tree deliberately and update the SHA on the first line of this
  file in the same commit (then regenerate golden fixtures per
  `.planning/research/STACK.md`).
- The API reads this file at startup to stamp `skill_revision` into
  every health/chart provenance payload (`api/lemastra_api/provenance.py`).
- Licensing: AGPL-3.0 — `LICENSE` and `tools/NOTICE.md` travel with the
  tree (see `docs/governance/swiss-ephemeris-posture.md` for the
  Swiss Ephemeris licensing posture).
